# "Roles"). Maintainers and committers can propose such a change; a build admin approves it.
# GitHub reads this file from the base branch, so a pull request cannot loosen it for itself.
# Every pattern must match a file (.github/scripts/tests/CodeOwners.Tests.ps1).

